	"id": "attackenemy.umiri_withanno.hint",
	"actionid": "operate",
	"label": "Raid the Enemy Commander?",
	"startdescription": "She is entrenched deep behind enemy lines. Killing her would be a fantasy—but if the opportunity permits, we might be able to raid her command post. Perhaps at the end of the liberation of Italy, we can join forces with the New Army and slay this terrible rival...\n\n[You need to find another way to make this commander withdraw.]",
